# 小屏, a finger: the home's chats, four one-second drags down the list, then let it coast. Its first rows are seen
# before, and gone after: the drags hit the list and scrolled its rows.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
until 今天
wait 500
log measure
drag 195 700 0 -430 1000
drag 195 700 0 -430 1000
drag 195 700 0 -430 1000
drag 195 700 0 -430 1000
wait 317
gone 整理发布清单
gone 今天
until 天前
exit
